    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[0].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Serve me a beer
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[10].wrongDrinkDialogue
      value: That's not what I asked for. Again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[11].wrongDrinkDialogue
      value: That's not what I asked for. Again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[12].wrongDrinkDialogue
      value: I know you. Do better.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[13].wrongDrinkDialogue
      value: You're not making a killing. Again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[14].wrongDrinkDialogue
      value: You're not making a killing. Again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[1].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Hi, Kid. Ready for your new career? <color=red>Bartender Assassin</color>!
        <color=blue>Press [SPACE] while looking at me to continue.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[2].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Put it in the <color=red>Beer Tap</color> by releasing it there, then
        fill it by <color=red>holding [SPACE]</color>. <color=blue>Click me to Continue</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[3].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: <color=blue>Beer in a Beer Mug</color>. I believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[3].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Now, <color=blue>serve me Beer in a Beer Mug</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[4].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Take a <color=red>Lowball Glass</color> from you right, and fill it
        with Rum by pressing its <color=red>Shortcut</color>. and <color=blue>serve
        it to me</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[4].stepStartedDialogue
      value: "That\u2019s the one. Remember that when filling a glass with <color=red>Cola
        or Ginger Beer</color>, you <color=red>don't need to hold down [SPACE], just
        press it once</color>."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[5].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Take a <color=red>Lowball Glass</color> from you right, and fill it
        with Rum by pressing its <color=red>Shortcut</color>, and <color=blue>serve
        it to me</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[5].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Now, you need to learn <color=red>Shortcuts</color>. Take a <color=red>Lowball
        Glass</color> from you right, and fill it with Rum by pressing its <color=red>Shortcut</color>.
        Then <color=blue>serve it to me</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[6].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass. I believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[6].stepStartedDialogue
      value: "Perfect. Now, let\u2019s <color=red>Mix a Drink</color>. We\u2019ll
        start easy with <color=red>\u201CBlow My Skull\u201D.</color>  You can see
        the recipe on the Menu to the right. <color=blue>Click it to continue</color>."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[7].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: <color=blue>Beer, Rum, Lowball Glass</color>. I believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[7].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Take a <color=red>Lowball glass, fill it with Rum and Beer</color>,
        and <color=blue>Serve it me</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[8].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass. I believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[8].stepStartedDialogue
      value: 'Excellent. And the final lesson of the day: <color=red>Murder</color>.
        Your Target will reveal themself if you <color=blue>impress the Customers</color>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[9].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass. I believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[9].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Do this by serving them and raising their <color=red>Satisfaction</color>.
        As you do, the odds of your <color=red>Target</color> approaching your bar
        increases.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[10].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass. I believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[10].stepStartedDialogue
      value: When you find your Target, give them the right drink, and put <color=red>Poison
        in it</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[11].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass. I believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[11].stepStartedDialogue
      value: Crouch with [SCROLL] and look under the desk to your right. See the
        <color=red>Poison Ampoule</color>? <color=blue>Click it to continue</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[12].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: <color=blue>Beer and Rum in a Lowball Glass. Top it off with Poison</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[12].stepStartedDialogue
      value: And finally, serve me a <color=red>Poisonous Blow My Skull</color> to
        <color=blue>finish your lesson</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[13].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass. Top it off with Poison.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[13].stepStartedDialogue
      value: "Good job, kid. Imperceptible sleight of hand. Though I\u2019m not going
        to drink it. Now, <color=blue>time to start your mission</color>."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[14].repeatOrderDialogue
      value: Beer and Rum in a Whiskey Glass. Top it off with Poison.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6672725777763676241, guid: e49708223bec4b342b3f53e2652642b5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorialSteps.Array.data[14].stepStartedDialogue
      value: I've updated your <color=red>Menu</color> with the <color=red>Drink
        Recipes</color> you'll need to start out. <color=blue>Your target is Obie
        Trice</color>, there's a discrete reminder on the menu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
